1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,714
As Uke comes to strike

2
00:00:01,715 --> 00:00:03,703
raise your arms up to control the strike

3
00:00:03,704 --> 00:00:06,837
and step in deeply to his rear 
turning at the same time.

4
00:00:06,838 --> 00:00:07,845
As he comes round

5
00:00:07,846 --> 00:00:10,051
step in deeply to his rear and cut down

6
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:12,805
as you do so control the wrist and his elbow,

7
00:00:12,806 --> 00:00:15,134
stepping around to turn Uke's body over.

8
00:00:15,435 --> 00:00:17,091
As you turn Uke's body over,

9
00:00:17,092 --> 00:00:18,805
controlling his wrist and elbow

10
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:20,011
bring your weight forward

11
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:23,683
pressing down on the back of the wrist 
until he releases the knife.

